{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066052/block/singleImage/3279840/df/01M8D8T2VN41GFF6Z44YVJECC1.jpeg?updatedAt=1795742221\"/><p>深培中學是一所關愛學校，學生「被看見」，老師「勤創卓思」。感恩！ 2026 年我們榮獲「樂繫校園」傑出大獎，肯定團隊的深耕和努力。老師在「深培家舍」陪伴學生做功課、球類活動、晚飯至 8 時。「動人 CEO 」的狗狗特工每周到校陪伴有需要的學生成長。全港首創 Mapcraft 地圖教學法，我們相信誰都可以發光，只要找對地圖。誠邀大家 12 月 5 日來學校參觀，親身感受深培中學的關愛和温度。 深培中學 地址：屯門兆麟街18號 查詢：2452 4702</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.454706+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T03:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T09:29:58.447061+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:14.009044+00:00","content_hash":"c66a6d6c793c305035a44980121e8abbef229d884050a11e2fdd63e54d59f42c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.454706+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}